1
00:01:27,105 --> 00:01:31,325
The Scholar and the Emperor

2
00:01:38,185 --> 00:01:39,681
Please wait, miss.

3
00:01:39,705 --> 00:01:41,125
I'll find someone to play against you.

4
00:01:42,985 --> 00:01:44,325
I'll gamble with you.

5
00:01:49,225 --> 00:01:51,525
Please sit, honored guests.

6
00:01:55,985 --> 00:01:57,765
In that case,

7
00:01:59,265 --> 00:02:00,405
let's begin.

8
00:02:01,425 --> 00:02:02,601
The game begins.

9
00:02:02,625 --> 00:02:03,801
Honored guests,

10
00:02:03,825 --> 00:02:05,005
enjoy yourselves.

11
00:02:22,745 --> 00:02:23,801
The points are tied.

12
00:02:23,825 --> 00:02:25,641
According to the rules of
Xingrong Gambling House,

13
00:02:25,665 --> 00:02:27,201
the house has the advantage.

14
00:02:27,225 --> 00:02:28,241
Therefore,

15
00:02:28,265 --> 00:02:29,241
this young lady wins.

16
00:02:29,265 --> 00:02:31,681
In a gambling house, origins do not matter,

17
00:02:31,705 --> 00:02:33,005
nor does rank.

18
00:02:33,665 --> 00:02:34,965
Only skill matters.

19
00:02:35,825 --> 00:02:37,121
You won this round

20
00:02:37,145 --> 00:02:39,201
because of the gambling house's rules.

21
00:02:39,225 --> 00:02:41,561
If you disregard the rules, one day

22
00:02:41,585 --> 00:02:43,281
you too will be thrown out of the game.

23
00:02:43,305 --> 00:02:45,125
If you made the rules,

24
00:02:45,665 --> 00:02:46,801
I could do nothing even if I objected.

25
00:02:46,825 --> 00:02:48,001
But right now,

26
00:02:48,025 --> 00:02:49,081
a loss must be accepted.

27
00:02:49,105 --> 00:02:50,881
Since you are so determined to win,

28
00:02:50,905 --> 00:02:52,405
I'll see this through with you.

29
00:02:52,825 --> 00:02:54,005
Again.

30
00:03:03,465 --> 00:03:05,205
This young lady wins.

31
00:03:05,705 --> 00:03:07,125
Again.

32
00:03:37,185 --> 00:03:38,725
The young lady wins again.

33
00:03:41,305 --> 00:03:43,641
Since Young Master He has no silver left,

34
00:03:43,665 --> 00:03:46,285
he is no longer qualified to wager against me.

35
00:03:47,145 --> 00:03:48,605
Let's end it here today.

36
00:03:51,425 --> 00:03:53,601
Thank you, honored guests.

37
00:03:53,625 --> 00:03:55,801
Our gambling house offers many other games.

38
00:03:55,825 --> 00:03:57,841
Why not rest in a private room?

39
00:03:57,865 --> 00:03:59,165
Your luck may improve later.

40
00:04:17,665 --> 00:04:19,725
Honored guests, please take a short rest.

41
00:04:30,425 --> 00:04:32,525
Situ Xue was not sent here by me.

42
00:04:54,385 --> 00:04:56,085
Why is Your Majesty following me?

43
00:04:56,905 --> 00:04:58,921
When investigating places like this,

44
00:04:58,945 --> 00:04:59,881
it is better to bring someone along.

45
00:04:59,905 --> 00:05:01,081
But at the Bureau,

46
00:05:01,105 --> 00:05:03,241
apart from the pretty-faced
fellow you mentioned,

47
00:05:03,265 --> 00:05:04,401
there is no one else.

48
00:05:04,425 --> 00:05:06,401
Do you want the entire
gambling house to know

49
00:05:06,425 --> 00:05:07,361
that the ruler of this realm

50
00:05:07,385 --> 00:05:08,921
came here to gamble with you
so you could vent your anger?

51
00:05:08,945 --> 00:05:11,285
Outside the palace, just call me He Du.

52
00:05:16,465 --> 00:05:17,765
After Shazhou,

53
00:05:18,785 --> 00:05:20,045
He Du ceased to exist.

54
00:05:22,625 --> 00:05:25,165
Your Majesty's every
word and action teaches me

55
00:05:25,465 --> 00:05:27,681
the difference between ruler and subject.

56
00:05:27,705 --> 00:05:30,525
We should each keep to our proper place.

57
00:05:43,025 --> 00:05:44,325
What are you doing here?

58
00:05:50,185 --> 00:05:51,325
A-Yue.

59
00:05:53,185 --> 00:05:55,245
-A-Gui.
-A-Yue.

60
00:05:57,185 --> 00:05:59,001
This is all the silver I saved this month.

61
00:05:59,025 --> 00:06:00,601
Give it to Sister Meng

62
00:06:00,625 --> 00:06:01,841
and beg her to show mercy.

63
00:06:01,865 --> 00:06:03,241
Ask whether sending you to the second floor

64
00:06:03,265 --> 00:06:04,961
can be postponed a little longer.

65
00:06:04,985 --> 00:06:06,165
Here.

66
00:06:10,225 --> 00:06:11,365
A-Gui,

67
00:06:11,985 --> 00:06:14,005
you have already bribed
everyone you could for me.

68
00:06:15,345 --> 00:06:16,525
But now,

69
00:06:16,985 --> 00:06:19,005
Uncle Hao personally chose me.

70
00:06:19,505 --> 00:06:21,045
Tomorrow's game on the second floor...

71
00:06:22,625 --> 00:06:24,205
I cannot escape it.

72
00:06:29,425 --> 00:06:31,525
I embroidered this handkerchief myself.

73
00:06:33,905 --> 00:06:35,845
Keep it as something to remember me by.

74
00:06:44,425 --> 00:06:45,481
I won't let them take you upstairs.

75
00:06:45,505 --> 00:06:47,121
There are still several hours left.

76
00:06:47,145 --> 00:06:48,645
I'll find the money.

77
00:06:50,465 --> 00:06:51,801
A-Yue,

78
00:06:51,825 --> 00:06:53,405
wait for me.

79
00:07:08,505 --> 00:07:09,761
Honored guests,

80
00:07:09,785 --> 00:07:11,601
our gambling house has many new games.

81
00:07:11,625 --> 00:07:13,445
Shall I take you to play a few more rounds?

82
00:07:14,945 --> 00:07:16,085
A-Gui.

83
00:07:16,625 --> 00:07:18,685
I heard your gambling house
is full of remarkable people.

84
00:07:19,345 --> 00:07:21,765
I came today hoping to
gather some information.

85
00:07:22,625 --> 00:07:24,165
Who would have thought

86
00:07:24,425 --> 00:07:26,485
I would win so much silver?

87
00:07:27,905 --> 00:07:30,241
What information are you seeking?

88
00:07:30,265 --> 00:07:31,485
Perhaps I can help.

89
00:07:35,625 --> 00:07:37,285
Do you know the Tiger Roar Gang?

90
00:07:52,345 --> 00:07:54,161
If you want information
about the Tiger Roar Gang,

91
00:07:54,185 --> 00:07:55,081
bring six hundred taels

92
00:07:55,105 --> 00:07:56,645
and wait for me at the rear entrance.

93
00:08:57,745 --> 00:08:59,201
After all these years,

94
00:08:59,225 --> 00:09:01,161
you finally achieved your wish

95
00:09:01,185 --> 00:09:03,441
and became a powerful gang leader.

96
00:09:03,465 --> 00:09:05,041
When my mother and I

97
00:09:05,065 --> 00:09:07,085
were abandoned by that beast,

98
00:09:07,865 --> 00:09:09,445
I secretly vowed

99
00:09:10,105 --> 00:09:11,445
that I would become strong.

100
00:09:11,945 --> 00:09:13,765
Only by holding the initiative

101
00:09:14,225 --> 00:09:17,165
can you avoid being discarded like a dog.

102
00:09:19,345 --> 00:09:20,485
Enough.

103
00:09:21,225 --> 00:09:22,485
It is all in the past.

104
00:09:26,305 --> 00:09:27,445
Pavilion Master Liu,

105
00:09:28,945 --> 00:09:30,085
I'll go take a look.

106
00:09:50,345 --> 00:09:51,485
Where is the silver?

107
00:09:54,945 --> 00:09:56,321
What exactly do you know?

108
00:09:56,345 --> 00:09:58,121
We need to know what it is worth first.

109
00:09:58,145 --> 00:09:59,641
If I tell you

110
00:09:59,665 --> 00:10:01,241
and you go back on your word?

111
00:10:01,265 --> 00:10:02,685
Give me the silver first.

112
00:10:03,305 --> 00:10:05,041
What if you are deceiving us?

113
00:10:05,065 --> 00:10:06,645
The second floor of this gambling house

114
00:10:07,065 --> 00:10:08,921
hides an unspeakable secret.

115
00:10:08,945 --> 00:10:10,165
The force protecting it

116
00:10:10,785 --> 00:10:11,925
is the Tiger Roar Gang.

117
00:10:14,345 --> 00:10:15,605
What secret?

118
00:10:17,585 --> 00:10:18,761
I have worked here for a year.

119
00:10:18,785 --> 00:10:20,161
I know many secrets

120
00:10:20,185 --> 00:10:21,801
between the Tiger Roar Gang
and this gambling house.

121
00:10:21,825 --> 00:10:23,121
If you want to know more,

122
00:10:23,145 --> 00:10:24,321
give me the money first.

123
00:10:24,345 --> 00:10:25,321
I urgently need it to save A-Yue.

124
00:10:25,345 --> 00:10:26,601
Who is A-Yue?

125
00:10:26,625 --> 00:10:27,841
A-Yue is from my hometown.

126
00:10:27,865 --> 00:10:29,601
She is about to be
sent to the second floor.

127
00:10:29,625 --> 00:10:30,681
We'll go with you.

128
00:10:30,705 --> 00:10:31,841
No.

129
00:10:31,865 --> 00:10:33,961
If the gambling house
learns about our deal,

130
00:10:33,985 --> 00:10:35,205
A-Yue and I

131
00:10:35,825 --> 00:10:37,361
will both be killed.

132
00:10:37,385 --> 00:10:38,361
Please.

133
00:10:38,385 --> 00:10:40,565
I truly need this money urgently.

134
00:10:40,985 --> 00:10:42,281
Wait here for half an hour.

135
00:10:42,305 --> 00:10:43,721
Just half an hour.

136
00:10:43,745 --> 00:10:44,885
I swear

137
00:10:45,665 --> 00:10:46,845
I will come back.

138
00:10:50,465 --> 00:10:51,965
Thank you.

139
00:10:54,665 --> 00:10:57,245
He said A-Yue was
about to be sent upstairs.

140
00:10:58,105 --> 00:11:00,325
What secret is hidden on the second floor?

141
00:11:00,705 --> 00:11:02,961
Since it concerns the Tiger Roar Gang,

142
00:11:02,985 --> 00:11:05,445
we must find a way to investigate.

143
00:11:15,185 --> 00:11:16,965
It seems people from the Bureau

144
00:11:17,465 --> 00:11:20,121
went to Evening Fragrance
Pavilion looking for you.

145
00:11:20,145 --> 00:11:22,605
They have come to us of their own accord.

146
00:11:22,905 --> 00:11:24,645
Meng Tinghui survived,

147
00:11:25,265 --> 00:11:26,441
and you killed Wan Kai.

148
00:11:26,465 --> 00:11:27,921
Now,

149
00:11:27,945 --> 00:11:29,405
the imperial court's attention

150
00:11:29,665 --> 00:11:30,801
is fixed on the Tiger Roar Gang.

151
00:11:30,825 --> 00:11:32,161
What should we do next?

152
00:11:32,185 --> 00:11:33,325
What is there to fear?

153
00:11:33,985 --> 00:11:35,881
She escaped last time.

154
00:11:35,905 --> 00:11:38,245
I would like to see
how capable she truly is

155
00:11:39,105 --> 00:11:41,125
and whether she can escape my grasp again.

156
00:11:47,585 --> 00:11:48,601
There is no need to worry.

157
00:11:48,625 --> 00:11:51,285
Do we not have someone
in the imperial court?

158
00:11:52,745 --> 00:11:54,445
I'm worried about you.

159
00:11:55,305 --> 00:11:56,605
Even he

160
00:11:57,185 --> 00:11:59,241
may not sincerely protect you.

161
00:11:59,265 --> 00:12:01,485
Have you forgotten how he used you before?

162
00:12:01,865 --> 00:12:03,321
The higher an official rises,

163
00:12:03,345 --> 00:12:04,641
the more ruthless his heart becomes.

164
00:12:04,665 --> 00:12:06,121
The higher an official rises,

165
00:12:06,145 --> 00:12:08,161
the more carefully he
weighs gains and losses,

166
00:12:08,185 --> 00:12:09,725
and the more he fears exposing himself.

167
00:12:10,025 --> 00:12:12,161
Proceed with our plan to make money.

168
00:12:12,185 --> 00:12:13,445
Do not lose your composure.

169
00:12:13,705 --> 00:12:15,125
As for Meng Tinghui,

170
00:12:16,305 --> 00:12:18,325
sooner or later, I will
make her fall into my hands.

171
00:12:19,505 --> 00:12:20,681
You...

172
00:12:20,705 --> 00:12:22,161
If anyone in Evening Fragrance Pavilion

173
00:12:22,185 --> 00:12:24,361
dares reveal my whereabouts,

174
00:12:24,385 --> 00:12:26,201
just kill them.

175
00:12:26,225 --> 00:12:27,365
I understand.

176
00:12:31,585 --> 00:12:32,725
Remember,

177
00:12:33,185 --> 00:12:34,325
in this world,

178
00:12:34,625 --> 00:12:36,205
anyone may betray me

179
00:12:37,145 --> 00:12:38,485
except you.

180
00:12:39,825 --> 00:12:41,325
Because

181
00:12:41,945 --> 00:12:43,685
I could never bear to hurt you.

182
00:12:47,505 --> 00:12:48,721
In this world,

183
00:12:48,745 --> 00:12:50,765
you may distrust anyone,

184
00:12:51,145 --> 00:12:53,165
but you must trust me.

185
00:13:00,545 --> 00:13:02,241
Half an hour has already passed.

186
00:13:02,265 --> 00:13:03,685
Let's go inside and see.

187
00:13:16,185 --> 00:13:17,485
What happened?

188
00:13:18,145 --> 00:13:19,525
A-Gui.

189
00:13:27,465 --> 00:13:29,645
Save...

190
00:13:30,825 --> 00:13:32,525
A-Yue.

191
00:14:23,185 --> 00:14:24,325
What are you staring at?

192
00:14:24,705 --> 00:14:25,721
Move aside.

193
00:14:25,745 --> 00:14:27,565
Have you never seen someone
kill himself over gambling?

194
00:14:29,145 --> 00:14:30,285
Come on.

195
00:14:31,305 --> 00:14:32,445
What rotten luck.

196
00:14:56,545 --> 00:14:58,605
Dinner is ready. Let's eat first.

197
00:15:00,305 --> 00:15:02,525
Wan Kai left this before he died.

198
00:15:03,225 --> 00:15:05,045
What was he trying to tell us?

199
00:15:12,865 --> 00:15:15,445
With my many years of
traveling the martial world,

200
00:15:15,825 --> 00:15:17,765
crossing mountains and rivers,

201
00:15:18,225 --> 00:15:20,525
and reading countless books...

202
00:15:26,665 --> 00:15:27,561
I still have no idea.

203
00:15:27,585 --> 00:15:28,881
I suggest

204
00:15:28,905 --> 00:15:30,125
we eat first.

205
00:15:33,865 --> 00:15:35,645
Could this be a map?

206
00:15:37,465 --> 00:15:39,081
The Tiger Roar Gang tried to kill him.

207
00:15:39,105 --> 00:15:41,001
He bore them a grudge,

208
00:15:41,025 --> 00:15:42,801
so perhaps he used this map

209
00:15:42,825 --> 00:15:44,921
to guide us to their stronghold.

210
00:15:44,945 --> 00:15:47,041
Assistant Shen makes an excellent point.

211
00:15:47,065 --> 00:15:48,801
But his life was hanging by a thread.

212
00:15:48,825 --> 00:15:50,921
Drawing a map would have taken too long.

213
00:15:50,945 --> 00:15:53,685
A message left at the brink of death

214
00:15:55,105 --> 00:15:56,401
may instead concern someone's identity.

215
00:15:56,425 --> 00:15:58,401
Official Meng's reasoning
is even more convincing.

216
00:15:58,425 --> 00:15:59,765
An identity?

217
00:16:00,825 --> 00:16:02,005
Who could it be?

218
00:16:04,225 --> 00:16:06,045
The lead from Wan Kai has gone cold.

219
00:16:07,705 --> 00:16:08,761
What about you two?

220
00:16:08,785 --> 00:16:10,841
Did you learn anything while
searching Changle Street?

221
00:16:10,865 --> 00:16:12,881
Everything else appeared normal.

222
00:16:12,905 --> 00:16:14,685
But I visited Evening Fragrance
Pavilion for several days

223
00:16:14,905 --> 00:16:16,681
and never saw its proprietor.

224
00:16:16,705 --> 00:16:18,001
Ordinarily,

225
00:16:18,025 --> 00:16:19,481
the proprietor should
personally receive guests.

226
00:16:19,505 --> 00:16:20,765
Other than that,

227
00:16:21,025 --> 00:16:22,685
I found nothing suspicious.

228
00:16:23,385 --> 00:16:25,601
I investigated the teahouses,
clinics, and other places,

229
00:16:25,625 --> 00:16:26,921
but found nothing unusual for now.

230
00:16:26,945 --> 00:16:28,441
If something is suspicious,

231
00:16:28,465 --> 00:16:29,681
we cannot lower our guard.

232
00:16:29,705 --> 00:16:32,725
Our clearest lead to the Tiger Roar Gang

233
00:16:33,425 --> 00:16:34,441
is still that gambling house.

234
00:16:34,465 --> 00:16:35,601
Then seal it.

235
00:16:35,625 --> 00:16:36,961
Under the Great Ning Code,

236
00:16:36,985 --> 00:16:38,601
we need conclusive
evidence before sealing it.

237
00:16:38,625 --> 00:16:40,441
The gambling house
appears to operate normally,

238
00:16:40,465 --> 00:16:41,761
and gambling is not
forbidden in Great Ning.

239
00:16:41,785 --> 00:16:43,161
It is still considered a lawful business.

240
00:16:43,185 --> 00:16:44,881
We should not alert them yet.

241
00:16:44,905 --> 00:16:46,325
But there is one matter

242
00:16:47,105 --> 00:16:48,405
for which I need your help.

243
00:16:58,625 --> 00:17:01,041
Place your bets. No more bets.

244
00:17:01,065 --> 00:17:04,245
-No more bets.
-This way, please.

245
00:17:05,025 --> 00:17:06,281
Come on. Place your bets.

246
00:17:06,305 --> 00:17:07,761
No more bets. Big.

247
00:17:07,785 --> 00:17:09,601
-Open it.
-Open it.

248
00:17:09,625 --> 00:17:11,045
No more bets.

249
00:17:23,785 --> 00:17:24,925
This way, please.

250
00:17:25,305 --> 00:17:26,445
What is it?

251
00:17:31,145 --> 00:17:32,285
Nothing.

252
00:17:34,105 --> 00:17:36,441
Zhili, Yin Qing, and Fuzhi

253
00:17:36,465 --> 00:17:38,321
gave everything they could

254
00:17:38,345 --> 00:17:40,081
and barely gathered one thousand taels.

255
00:17:40,105 --> 00:17:41,921
We need to win ten rounds in a row

256
00:17:41,945 --> 00:17:43,121
to turn it into ten thousand.

257
00:17:43,145 --> 00:17:45,361
But we also have you, Young Master He.

258
00:17:45,385 --> 00:17:46,841
Since you arranged to go upstairs,

259
00:17:46,865 --> 00:17:48,565
you must have prepared the silver.

260
00:17:54,105 --> 00:17:55,405
I knew it.

261
00:17:56,665 --> 00:17:58,121
When it comes to extravagant spending,

262
00:17:58,145 --> 00:17:59,241
who in all of Great Ning

263
00:17:59,265 --> 00:18:00,921
would dare steal your
spotlight, Young Master He?

264
00:18:00,945 --> 00:18:02,041
This is

265
00:18:02,065 --> 00:18:03,925
half a year's worth of my private savings.

266
00:18:04,385 --> 00:18:05,685
But honestly,

267
00:18:06,865 --> 00:18:09,441
you are not as miserly

268
00:18:09,465 --> 00:18:10,521
as Young Master Shen claimed.

269
00:18:10,545 --> 00:18:11,841
-What did you say?
-Young Master He.

270
00:18:11,865 --> 00:18:13,645
The investigation comes first.

271
00:18:15,985 --> 00:18:17,285
Again.

272
00:18:23,265 --> 00:18:24,485
Now that is a bold wager.

273
00:18:27,625 --> 00:18:29,365
I bet on big.

274
00:18:30,385 --> 00:18:31,525
Stingy.

275
00:18:34,225 --> 00:18:35,961
Ten thousand taels on big.

276
00:18:35,985 --> 00:18:37,645
One round decides everything.

277
00:18:39,905 --> 00:18:41,801
Ten thousand taels on small.

278
00:18:41,825 --> 00:18:43,165
Small. I bet on small too.

279
00:18:48,585 --> 00:18:50,521
Very well. No more bets.

280
00:18:50,545 --> 00:18:57,845
-Small.
-Small.

281
00:18:59,145 --> 00:19:00,285
Big.

282
00:19:01,065 --> 00:19:02,605
-Small.
-Small.

283
00:19:04,505 --> 00:19:06,801
From the way you threw money around,

284
00:19:06,825 --> 00:19:09,161
I thought you were an expert.

285
00:19:09,185 --> 00:19:12,085
It turns out you truly are an expert.

286
00:19:12,345 --> 00:19:13,485
Indeed.

287
00:19:14,225 --> 00:19:15,481
Ten thousand taels

288
00:19:15,505 --> 00:19:16,961
is hardly enough to buy some amusement.

289
00:19:16,985 --> 00:19:18,721
Since the games here are dull,

290
00:19:18,745 --> 00:19:20,365
let's try another gambling house.

291
00:19:22,905 --> 00:19:24,045
All right.

292
00:19:25,185 --> 00:19:27,565
Please wait, young masters.

293
00:19:29,745 --> 00:19:31,921
If a distinguished patron like you leaves,

294
00:19:31,945 --> 00:19:33,041
our proprietor

295
00:19:33,065 --> 00:19:34,401
will say I do not know how to treat guests.

296
00:19:34,425 --> 00:19:35,401
What?

297
00:19:35,425 --> 00:19:37,245
Are we not even allowed to leave?

298
00:19:37,665 --> 00:19:38,561
You misunderstand, young master.

299
00:19:38,585 --> 00:19:41,561
We are the only gambling house
endorsed by a capital official.

300
00:19:41,585 --> 00:19:43,405
We would never deceive our guests.

301
00:19:44,265 --> 00:19:45,845
Guaranteed by a capital official?

302
00:19:46,465 --> 00:19:47,681
Interesting.

303
00:19:47,705 --> 00:19:49,361
Young master,

304
00:19:49,385 --> 00:19:51,321
your magnificent display of spending today

305
00:19:51,345 --> 00:19:52,921
has deeply impressed us.

306
00:19:52,945 --> 00:19:55,601
Our proprietor specially
invited you upstairs

307
00:19:55,625 --> 00:19:58,081
to experience a more entertaining game.

308
00:19:58,105 --> 00:19:59,725
We hope you will honor us.

309
00:20:02,025 --> 00:20:03,921
So Young Master He planned this all along.

310
00:20:03,945 --> 00:20:05,405
We were never meant
to win that ten thousand.

311
00:20:06,705 --> 00:20:08,165
Unfortunately, I bet on big.

312
00:20:09,585 --> 00:20:11,365
Deduct it from your salary.

313
00:20:12,625 --> 00:20:14,521
Once upstairs,

314
00:20:14,545 --> 00:20:16,205
honored guests must
not speak unnecessarily.

315
00:20:16,825 --> 00:20:18,761
What is tonight's game?

316
00:20:18,785 --> 00:20:21,401
You cannot expect us to wager
without knowing anything.

317
00:20:21,425 --> 00:20:23,565
Every game is carefully arranged by us.

318
00:20:24,025 --> 00:20:25,841
If you find it interesting,

319
00:20:25,865 --> 00:20:27,085
you may join.

320
00:20:27,465 --> 00:20:29,401
Since this is your first visit,

321
00:20:29,425 --> 00:20:30,921
I will make an exception
and reveal a little.

322
00:20:30,945 --> 00:20:32,321
Tonight is a blind auction.

323
00:20:32,345 --> 00:20:33,561
The wagers are

324
00:20:33,585 --> 00:20:35,085
antique porcelain vases.

325
00:20:35,545 --> 00:20:38,125
Mere antiques are hardly remarkable.

326
00:20:39,065 --> 00:20:40,321
Do not be impatient, young master.

327
00:20:40,345 --> 00:20:42,161
After you win one,

328
00:20:42,185 --> 00:20:44,881
you will discover the
hidden delight within.

329
00:20:44,905 --> 00:20:45,961
Remember,

330
00:20:45,985 --> 00:20:47,681
speaking is forbidden during the game.

331
00:20:47,705 --> 00:20:49,285
Only a silent wager

332
00:20:49,705 --> 00:20:51,525
reveals the true pleasure.

333
00:21:07,425 --> 00:21:09,601
This way, please.

334
00:21:09,625 --> 00:21:11,481
The real game

335
00:21:11,505 --> 00:21:13,245
has begun.

336
00:21:26,745 --> 00:21:28,161
Here are the rules for tonight.

337
00:21:28,185 --> 00:21:30,241
Simply write the number of

338
00:21:30,265 --> 00:21:32,521
your chosen antique vase in a letter.

339
00:21:32,545 --> 00:21:33,761
After the gong sounds three times,

340
00:21:33,785 --> 00:21:36,965
the highest bidder wins the treasure.

341
00:22:01,265 --> 00:22:02,361
There is nothing special

342
00:22:02,385 --> 00:22:04,281
about these antique vases.

343
00:22:04,305 --> 00:22:05,601
But these women

344
00:22:05,625 --> 00:22:07,641
are all gentle and refined.

345
00:22:07,665 --> 00:22:10,005
Every movement resembles
that of a well-bred lady.

346
00:22:10,425 --> 00:22:11,841
If they are only wagering on porcelain,

347
00:22:11,865 --> 00:22:14,685
why dress the women like scholars?

348
00:22:17,905 --> 00:22:19,561
Their skin is as white as snow.

349
00:22:19,585 --> 00:22:21,361
They have neither the
calluses of poor women

350
00:22:21,385 --> 00:22:23,361
nor the seductive air of courtesans.

351
00:22:23,385 --> 00:22:24,881
Could they, like A-Yue,

352
00:22:24,905 --> 00:22:26,201
be women forced into this?

353
00:22:26,225 --> 00:22:28,405
Everything here feels strange.

354
00:22:29,025 --> 00:22:30,401
We must find A-Yue first

355
00:22:30,425 --> 00:22:31,805
to learn the truth.

356
00:23:20,785 --> 00:23:22,241
Tonight's most popular item

357
00:23:22,265 --> 00:23:24,121
is this willow-leaf vase
from the previous dynasty.

358
00:23:24,145 --> 00:23:25,681
Congratulations to this honored guest,

359
00:23:25,705 --> 00:23:27,761
who wagered twenty thousand taels

360
00:23:27,785 --> 00:23:29,245
and won the grand prize.

361
00:23:37,825 --> 00:23:40,725
A-Gui...

362
00:23:42,145 --> 00:23:43,281
That is A-Yue.

363
00:23:43,305 --> 00:23:44,401
A-Gui.

364
00:23:44,425 --> 00:23:46,325
They were never gambling on the vases.

365
00:23:47,385 --> 00:23:48,525
Follow them.

366
00:23:58,585 --> 00:23:59,725
Harder.

367
00:24:00,985 --> 00:24:02,485
A little harder.

368
00:24:07,265 --> 00:24:08,645
Good.

369
00:24:09,665 --> 00:24:11,405
A little harder.

370
00:24:12,265 --> 00:24:13,361
Good.

371
00:24:13,385 --> 00:24:14,845
That's the right pressure.

372
00:24:15,545 --> 00:24:16,685
Good.

373
00:24:16,985 --> 00:24:17,881
Good.

374
00:24:17,905 --> 00:24:19,445
Good...

375
00:24:23,265 --> 00:24:24,201
My lord,

376
00:24:24,225 --> 00:24:25,885
look at this...

377
00:24:26,505 --> 00:24:28,645
What brings you here?

378
00:24:29,065 --> 00:24:30,725
Come, sit down.

379
00:24:31,465 --> 00:24:32,805
Uncle Hao,

380
00:24:33,145 --> 00:24:34,881
you seem to be living comfortably.

381
00:24:34,905 --> 00:24:37,361
Have you nearly forgotten
whose gambling house this is?

382
00:24:37,385 --> 00:24:38,881
Master,

383
00:24:38,905 --> 00:24:41,001
how could you say that?

384
00:24:41,025 --> 00:24:43,121
I would never dare forget

385
00:24:43,145 --> 00:24:46,085
that our gang leader is the true
owner of this gambling house.

386
00:24:46,625 --> 00:24:48,801
Business has simply been
booming these past few days,

387
00:24:48,825 --> 00:24:49,961
so I thought

388
00:24:49,985 --> 00:24:51,405
I would relax a little.

389
00:24:51,905 --> 00:24:53,045
By the way, Master,

390
00:24:55,185 --> 00:24:57,281
this is the gambling house's recent income.

391
00:24:57,305 --> 00:24:58,805
Please inspect it.

392
00:25:02,905 --> 00:25:04,045
Not bad.

393
00:25:05,025 --> 00:25:06,601
With the gambling house in your hands,

394
00:25:06,625 --> 00:25:08,045
I can rest assured.

395
00:25:08,385 --> 00:25:09,525
But Uncle Hao,

396
00:25:10,065 --> 00:25:12,241
as your purse grows heavier,

397
00:25:12,265 --> 00:25:14,001
you must not forget the rules.

398
00:25:14,025 --> 00:25:16,041
How could I dare forget?

399
00:25:16,065 --> 00:25:18,841
I was just thinking of offering
more to the gang leader.

400
00:25:18,865 --> 00:25:20,001
By the way, Master,

401
00:25:20,025 --> 00:25:23,081
if the gambling house in the
eastern city also comes under me,

402
00:25:23,105 --> 00:25:25,121
you will certainly receive your share.

403
00:25:25,145 --> 00:25:26,845
Please wait, Master.

404
00:25:33,945 --> 00:25:35,165
Master.

405
00:25:38,105 --> 00:25:39,325
Master.

406
00:25:42,705 --> 00:25:43,845
There is one more matter.

407
00:25:44,265 --> 00:25:46,041
Recently, the Bureau...

408
00:25:46,065 --> 00:25:47,365
Uncle Hao.

409
00:25:48,105 --> 00:25:49,245
Uncle Hao.

410
00:25:50,585 --> 00:25:51,725
Are you trying to get yourself killed?

411
00:25:52,145 --> 00:25:53,121
How many times have I told you

412
00:25:53,145 --> 00:25:54,561
to knock before entering?

413
00:25:54,585 --> 00:25:55,481
Yes.

414
00:25:55,505 --> 00:25:57,041
I'll go knock right now.

415
00:25:57,065 --> 00:25:58,205
Come back.

416
00:26:04,585 --> 00:26:06,521
Speak. What is it?

417
00:26:06,545 --> 00:26:09,001
If it is not something important,

418
00:26:09,025 --> 00:26:10,161
I'll skin you alive.

419
00:26:10,185 --> 00:26:11,281
Uncle Hao,

420
00:26:11,305 --> 00:26:13,925
this is Old Zhai, the gatekeeper.

421
00:26:15,425 --> 00:26:17,445
He says he has secret
information to report.

422
00:26:18,705 --> 00:26:19,845
Secret information?

423
00:26:20,745 --> 00:26:22,165
Uncle Hao...

424
00:26:22,585 --> 00:26:24,125
You are only a gatekeeper.

425
00:26:24,465 --> 00:26:26,001
A mere gatekeeper.

426
00:26:26,025 --> 00:26:27,281
What secret could you possibly know?

427
00:26:27,305 --> 00:26:28,881
-Uncle Hao.
-Why are all these nobodies

428
00:26:28,905 --> 00:26:30,401
being brought to me?

429
00:26:30,425 --> 00:26:32,201
Do you think this is a teahouse?

430
00:26:32,225 --> 00:26:34,001
Uncle Hao...

431
00:26:34,025 --> 00:26:35,601
Meng Tinghui from the Bureau

432
00:26:35,625 --> 00:26:37,161
brought a man to the second floor.

433
00:26:37,185 --> 00:26:38,681
-They have come with hostile intentions.
-You are just a gatekeeper.

434
00:26:38,705 --> 00:26:40,165
Are you certain it was her?

435
00:26:40,785 --> 00:26:41,965
Wait.

436
00:26:43,465 --> 00:26:46,001
People from the Bureau have recently been

437
00:26:46,025 --> 00:26:48,641
secretly investigating the gang
leader and me on Changle Street.

438
00:26:48,665 --> 00:26:50,681
Tell your men to stay alert.

439
00:26:50,705 --> 00:26:52,081
Do not let her find any evidence.

440
00:26:52,105 --> 00:26:54,325
They must not discover the
secret of the second floor.

441
00:26:54,785 --> 00:26:55,681
I'll handle it at once.

442
00:26:55,705 --> 00:26:57,885
Go.

443
00:27:24,305 --> 00:27:25,241
Honored guests,

444
00:27:25,265 --> 00:27:27,125
going any farther would violate the rules.

445
00:28:01,425 --> 00:28:02,725
It's A-Yue.

446
00:29:10,545 --> 00:29:12,005
A-Yue.

447
00:29:13,265 --> 00:29:15,241
-She is still breathing.
-There was movement just now.

448
00:29:15,265 --> 00:29:16,561
Where did they go? Find them.

449
00:29:16,585 --> 00:29:17,481
Go.

450
00:29:17,505 --> 00:29:19,165
Go.

451
00:29:40,105 --> 00:29:41,245
You...

452
00:29:44,465 --> 00:29:45,645
You are...

453
00:29:46,505 --> 00:29:48,485
the female Top Scholar who
placed first in all three exams.

454
00:29:49,185 --> 00:29:50,765
Official Meng.

455
00:29:51,225 --> 00:29:52,841
You saved me.

456
00:29:52,865 --> 00:29:54,765
A-Gui asked us to save you.

457
00:29:55,185 --> 00:29:56,325
A-Gui...

458
00:29:57,465 --> 00:29:58,605
Where is he?

459
00:30:01,305 --> 00:30:03,401
A-Gui risked his life trying to save you.

460
00:30:03,425 --> 00:30:05,645
He wanted you to live well.

461
00:30:12,145 --> 00:30:13,645
A-Gui.

462
00:30:18,785 --> 00:30:20,405
I caused this.

463
00:30:21,985 --> 00:30:24,441
I got you killed.

464
00:30:24,465 --> 00:30:26,121
You are very weak.

465
00:30:26,145 --> 00:30:27,645
Do not grieve too deeply.

466
00:30:27,985 --> 00:30:29,441
Whatever injustice you suffered,

467
00:30:29,465 --> 00:30:31,441
-tell Official Meng everything.
-That's right.

468
00:30:31,465 --> 00:30:33,685
My lady will obtain justice for you.

469
00:30:37,025 --> 00:30:38,881
We were

470
00:30:38,905 --> 00:30:41,645
female scholars preparing for
the next imperial examination.

471
00:30:43,265 --> 00:30:44,641
We came from poor and remote regions.

472
00:30:44,665 --> 00:30:47,445
Fortunately, His Majesty
reopened the women's examination,

473
00:30:47,945 --> 00:30:50,045
and Official Meng firmly
defended the decision.

474
00:30:50,385 --> 00:30:52,565
Only then did ordinary women like us

475
00:30:52,985 --> 00:30:54,365
see a path forward.

476
00:30:54,785 --> 00:30:55,925
Later,

477
00:30:56,385 --> 00:30:59,205
someone claimed to be an instructor
from the capital's women's academy

478
00:30:59,865 --> 00:31:02,161
and selected talented
women from every prefecture

479
00:31:02,185 --> 00:31:03,765
to study further in the capital.

480
00:31:04,505 --> 00:31:06,241
We believed them.

481
00:31:06,265 --> 00:31:07,605
But after reaching the capital,

482
00:31:08,345 --> 00:31:10,761
we were imprisoned in a residence.

483
00:31:10,785 --> 00:31:13,961
At first, they taught us music,
chess, calligraphy, and painting.

484
00:31:13,985 --> 00:31:15,561
Those who performed well were taken away

485
00:31:15,585 --> 00:31:17,161
and never heard from again.

486
00:31:17,185 --> 00:31:18,525
At the same time,

487
00:31:19,065 --> 00:31:20,805
new female scholars

488
00:31:21,265 --> 00:31:22,281
kept arriving at the residence.

489
00:31:22,305 --> 00:31:23,725
A-Yue,

490
00:31:25,705 --> 00:31:27,241
where in the capital is that residence?

491
00:31:27,265 --> 00:31:29,485
From our homes to the capital,

492
00:31:30,305 --> 00:31:31,441
they kept us inside

493
00:31:31,465 --> 00:31:33,601
sealed carriages with no view outside.

494
00:31:33,625 --> 00:31:34,561
After reaching the residence,

495
00:31:34,585 --> 00:31:36,361
we were never allowed to leave.

496
00:31:36,385 --> 00:31:38,165
How long have you been here?

497
00:31:39,465 --> 00:31:41,441
And how did you meet A-Gui?

498
00:31:41,465 --> 00:31:44,165
I came to the capital
over three months ago.

499
00:31:45,385 --> 00:31:46,765
By chance, I recognized A-Gui

500
00:31:47,105 --> 00:31:49,365
when he delivered
vegetables to the residence.

501
00:31:51,185 --> 00:31:52,565
From him,

502
00:31:53,065 --> 00:31:54,405
I learned

503
00:31:55,945 --> 00:31:58,045
that the female scholars
who were taken away

504
00:31:59,745 --> 00:32:02,441
were all sent to the second
floor of the gambling house.

505
00:32:02,465 --> 00:32:03,521
They were used as wagers

506
00:32:03,545 --> 00:32:06,685
for the gamblers' amusement.

507
00:32:08,225 --> 00:32:09,721
Those gamblers

508
00:32:09,745 --> 00:32:12,085
were twisted perverts.

509
00:32:12,865 --> 00:32:14,565
They treated women as playthings

510
00:32:14,865 --> 00:32:16,445
and used cruel methods.

511
00:32:17,545 --> 00:32:19,321
Only because of A-Gui

512
00:32:19,345 --> 00:32:22,285
was I able to avoid being
sent upstairs for so long.

513
00:32:23,385 --> 00:32:25,525
Did none of you try to escape?

514
00:32:29,625 --> 00:32:30,765
We did.

515
00:32:31,705 --> 00:32:33,085
We also reported it to the authorities.

516
00:32:34,865 --> 00:32:37,325
But the officials were working with them.

517
00:32:38,625 --> 00:32:40,961
Those who escaped were captured again,

518
00:32:40,985 --> 00:32:42,521
had their hands and feet cut off,

519
00:32:42,545 --> 00:32:44,325
and were tortured to death.

520
00:32:44,945 --> 00:32:47,805
Many female scholars could
not bear the humiliation

521
00:32:48,865 --> 00:32:50,925
and chose to take their own lives.

522
00:32:53,025 --> 00:32:55,445
Do you know which court officials

523
00:32:56,545 --> 00:32:58,445
were colluding with them?

524
00:33:02,305 --> 00:33:04,001
And who captured you?

525
00:33:04,025 --> 00:33:06,085
I only heard

526
00:33:07,425 --> 00:33:09,285
someone called Master Lü.

527
00:33:16,905 --> 00:33:17,881
He is Lü Er's elder brother.

528
00:33:17,905 --> 00:33:19,681
I saw him before.

529
00:33:19,705 --> 00:33:21,321
Do you know anything about

530
00:33:21,345 --> 00:33:22,885
the identities of the guests upstairs,

531
00:33:23,505 --> 00:33:25,485
especially the men who took you away?

532
00:33:26,185 --> 00:33:27,325
They...

533
00:33:28,305 --> 00:33:29,761
all wore masks.

534
00:33:29,785 --> 00:33:31,325
I only remember

535
00:33:32,425 --> 00:33:34,525
that one man wore a red jade thumb ring

536
00:33:34,945 --> 00:33:36,681
engraved with a bird in a cage.

537
00:33:36,705 --> 00:33:38,085
Last night

538
00:33:39,185 --> 00:33:40,845
was the first time I was taken...

539
00:33:42,385 --> 00:33:43,525
taken...

540
00:33:45,945 --> 00:33:47,845
A-Yue.

541
00:33:52,345 --> 00:33:53,725
Official Meng,

542
00:33:54,705 --> 00:33:56,005
thank you.

543
00:33:57,625 --> 00:33:59,005
I know

544
00:33:59,905 --> 00:34:01,445
the condition of my own body.

545
00:34:03,385 --> 00:34:05,005
There is no time left.

546
00:34:14,105 --> 00:34:15,325
Listen.

547
00:34:16,785 --> 00:34:18,845
That is the sound of studying.

548
00:34:57,185 --> 00:34:59,085
Kingdoms and states

549
00:34:59,385 --> 00:35:00,925
may be governed.

550
00:35:01,905 --> 00:35:03,085
Rank and wealth

551
00:35:03,905 --> 00:35:05,401
may be refused.

552
00:35:05,425 --> 00:35:06,805
Bare blades

553
00:35:07,705 --> 00:35:09,165
may be trodden upon.

554
00:35:10,985 --> 00:35:12,205
But the Doctrine of the Mean

555
00:35:13,585 --> 00:35:15,245
cannot be attained.

556
00:36:05,345 --> 00:36:06,685
A-Yue.

557
00:36:07,225 --> 00:36:08,445
I'm here.

558
00:36:15,225 --> 00:36:16,485
I'll take you away.

559
00:36:38,745 --> 00:36:40,525
A-Gui.

560
00:36:46,545 --> 00:36:47,845
A-Yue.

561
00:36:48,825 --> 00:36:50,005
-A-Yue.
-Official Meng.

562
00:36:52,185 --> 00:36:53,561
Official Meng,

563
00:36:53,585 --> 00:36:55,365
how I wished

564
00:36:56,665 --> 00:36:58,165
I could be like you,

565
00:37:00,065 --> 00:37:01,405
study,

566
00:37:03,065 --> 00:37:04,325
take the examination,

567
00:37:05,545 --> 00:37:06,845
and earn...

568
00:37:07,825 --> 00:37:09,325
honor.

569
00:37:16,945 --> 00:37:18,325
A-Yue.

570
00:37:21,185 --> 00:37:22,325
A-Yue.

571
00:37:44,145 --> 00:37:45,685
A-Yue.

572
00:37:46,585 --> 00:37:48,845
I will make those criminals

573
00:37:51,545 --> 00:37:53,845
repay this blood debt with their lives.

574
00:38:08,745 --> 00:38:10,641
Those gamblers spent lavishly.

575
00:38:10,665 --> 00:38:12,085
They must have powerful backgrounds.

576
00:38:13,265 --> 00:38:15,285
And those women received
no help after reporting it,

577
00:38:15,625 --> 00:38:16,961
which means that among the gamblers

578
00:38:16,985 --> 00:38:18,485
were court officials.

579
00:38:18,985 --> 00:38:20,601
The Tiger Roar Gang supplied those women

580
00:38:20,625 --> 00:38:22,161
for the officials' amusement

581
00:38:22,185 --> 00:38:24,081
and used it as leverage

582
00:38:24,105 --> 00:38:26,005
to turn them into their protectors.

583
00:38:30,065 --> 00:38:32,725
Those women had great ambitions.

584
00:38:33,825 --> 00:38:36,005
They wanted to serve the imperial court,

585
00:38:37,065 --> 00:38:38,761
but they were dragged into
the filth of officialdom

586
00:38:38,785 --> 00:38:40,241
and had their entire lives destroyed.

587
00:38:40,265 --> 00:38:41,845
The most absurd part

588
00:38:43,945 --> 00:38:45,725
is that these murderers

589
00:38:47,105 --> 00:38:48,845
sit in positions of power

590
00:38:49,345 --> 00:38:50,805
and act without restraint.

591
00:39:21,025 --> 00:39:22,605
Whether it is the Tiger Roar Gang

592
00:39:23,865 --> 00:39:25,525
or those corrupt officials,

593
00:39:26,625 --> 00:39:27,881
I will drag every one of you

594
00:39:27,905 --> 00:39:30,005
down from your lofty positions

595
00:39:30,465 --> 00:39:32,805
and reduce your bones to ashes.

596
00:39:34,065 --> 00:39:36,325
I will take our men and thoroughly
investigate the gambling house.

597
00:39:48,505 --> 00:39:50,441
I know you are furious,

598
00:39:50,465 --> 00:39:52,281
but only by planning carefully

599
00:39:52,305 --> 00:39:54,205
can we capture them all at once.

600
00:40:04,385 --> 00:40:05,721
I watched

601
00:40:05,745 --> 00:40:07,885
A-Yue die before my eyes.

602
00:40:08,265 --> 00:40:09,685
How can I remain calm?

603
00:40:14,105 --> 00:40:16,125
Your Majesty, I have come
to escort you back...

